{"author":"did:key:z6Mkmz8SWiUshwDMszSqwzMngt7ScNmsEj7vZoFRLjpcZTm9","evaluation":{"digest":{"sha256":"14965eb42319ba2d0be0c7c4f621efd78d5f73a7bf79626d317dd4e17ed730f2"}},"instructions":"Return exactly ACCEPT or REJECT.","network.jinn.binary-judgment.item-sha256":"sha256:086b1914c90269b1f205a35c63d492dd0ee3218ffb18fbd34e4481ba8ad66f95","outputs":[{"mediaType":"text/plain; charset=utf-8","name":"judge-response","required":true},{"mediaType":"application/vnd.jinn.binary-judgment.observation.v1+json","name":"judge-observation","required":true},{"mediaType":"application/vnd.inspect-ai.eval-log+json","name":"inspect-log","required":false}],"payload":{"candidateAnswer":"Set up a webcam near a local pond to watch birds remotely from his apartment.","evidence":"[D20:5 | 7:09 pm on 1 October, 2023] Andrew: Aww, they look so cute! That spot looks ideal for them to play. Where did you take them?\n[D20:21 | 7:09 pm on 1 October, 2023] Andrew: Nice! Looks like you're prepared. I'll bring my binos and a notebook to log them at the trip.\n[D23:1 | 4:22 pm on 13 October, 2023] Andrew: Hey Audrey, it's been a busy week for me. Last Tuesday, my gf, Toby, and I had a really awesome night playing board games. It was really nice. What's been up with you lately?\n[D1:14 | 1:10 pm on 27 March, 2023] Andrew: I've always been awed by birds. Their power to soar and explore new spots is amazing.","itemId":"urn:uuid:8f188a95-ef7f-5434-bea7-f083066f0ab8","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:2aa53fed27d433934e5b624eb7a014a693f2b409bbceb567a0618e054efe1e23","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What is something that Andrew could do to make birdwatching hobby to fit in his city schedule?","referenceAnswer":"Install a bird feeder outside where he can see the birds without going outdoors.","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"2aa53fed27d433934e5b624eb7a014a693f2b409bbceb567a0618e054efe1e23"}}]},"profile":{"digest":{"sha256":"ebb34d8362e2cc3135847a5ad6f3ee3d9c2d9922a2b827aa9dfcbaf440b22557"},"uri":"https://spec.jinn.network/task-profiles/binary-judgment/2.0"},"protocol":"https://spec.jinn.network/profiles/task-execution/v1"}